","sourceUrl","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699494&idx=2&sn=43c02651b1c838ce26d28bd0f8a73d3d&chksm=bc6298bb50c254f0caeef88d167ba52fc95a172ad1ca2feae6ffefd23c45708b9d9cfd1fed31&scene=126&sessionid=1793855733#rd","publishedAt","2026-11-04T16:00:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=920757ef74ebe49f","sourceIconSrcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=9cb8174b387e7452 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=920757ef74ebe49f 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"bishq0amt3d2me1pxgru72hw5","南方医院遴选处方流转合作药店，广东双通道单独支付征求意见同步推进","南方医科大学南方医院发布处方流转合作药店遴选公告，仅限广州医保双通道定点药店常态化申报，合作期限最长三年，分配送药店和回流药店两类，回流药店需具备30分钟送药回医院指定区域的能力。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699484&idx=1&sn=9b8714b740713df689dac9d0974b5730&chksm=bcc02bb23e9210a83743b542443e6d0a8ed0394ea45fefaa130229318d42ae6555ad91a7d710&scene=126&sessionid=1793855733#rd","2026-11-04T03:40:02.000Z",{"_117":145,"_94":-5,"_119":146},{"_117":118,"_94":-5,"_119":120},"label","政策与监管","items",[121,122,123],{"_91":140,"_39":141,"_94":142,"_96":97,"_98":143,"_100":144,"_102":103,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":109},{"_91":132,"_39":133,"_94":134,"_96":135,"_98":136,"_100":137,"_102":138,"_104":139,"_106":107,"_108":109},{"_91":124,"_39":125,"_94":126,"_96":127,"_98":128,"_100":129,"_102":130,"_104":131,"_106":109,"_108":109},"oe38y0k8hxh7ja9rqykh82srz","广东联盟取消西安利君康乐氯化钠注射液中选资格","广东省药品交易中心公告，因陕西省药监部门检查发现西安利君康乐制药有限责任公司药品生产质量管理不符合要求并已暂停其氯化钠注射液（250ml:2.25g、500ml:4.5g，直立式聚丙烯输液袋）生产、销售，依据《广东联盟双氯芬酸等药品接续采购文件（GDYJYPDL202501）》取消该产品在广东联盟双氯芬酸等药品接续采购的中选资格。","广东省药品交易中心·通知公告","https://www.gdmede.com.cn/announcement/announcement/detail?id=2117903816765476864","2026-11-03T16:00:00.000Z","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gdmede.com.cn%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=7b6790186a8c4652","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gdmede.com.cn%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=e585872dca2ffb01 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gdmede.com.cn%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=7b6790186a8c4652 96w","lkzlmmf8zqgfdbkl8wwpbzf4i","两款进口集采中选药因断供被取消资格，来曲唑片申报企业禁入4年","国家组织药品联合采购办公室公告取消两款国家集采中选药品的中选资格：Eugia Pharma的来曲唑片（第1—8批接续采购中选，申报企业杭州科图供应链）自接续采购执行以来未进行配送供应。","赛柏蓝","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTA4Mzc2Mg==&mid=2653669472&idx=2&sn=140f969345708404949ecf1c77273041&chksm=bc5d150067828c8fcef11ad97b6f4f4c494f44ea272c27a35f5de835be620e16fdb58931d2d0&scene=126&sessionid=1793855794#rd","2026-11-04T10:45:03.000Z","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=167030ae1e219003","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=b828ff70e947816f 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=167030ae1e219003 96w","j0dk3m0550gk6zzv8tgazfxa6","第十二批国采落地：北京11月28日执行，黑龙江、海南11月30日执行","11月3日北京、黑龙江、海南、吉林相继发布第十二批国采落地通知，北京明确11月28日0时全面执行中选结果、采购周期至2029年12月31日，黑龙江与海南均于11月30日执行。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699487&idx=1&sn=426c7bbd871be15c157c06f5f3213b31&chksm=bc1696242e440165a84ab2a44023b9e146ae23727d0d3416b23041ed56c03fef411b4326f158&scene=126&sessionid=1793855